      },
      "hints": [
        "Factorise $(3\\sin\\theta - 1)(\\sin\\theta + 3) = 0$.",
        "Solve for acute angle $\\theta = \\sin^{-1}(1/3)$ in degrees."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Factorise the quadratic in $\\sin\\theta$:\n$$(3\\sin\\theta - 1)(\\sin\\theta + 3) = 0$$",
        "Solve for the valid root (rejecting $\\sin\\theta = -3$):\n$$\\sin\\theta = \\frac{1}{3}$$",
        "Calculate the acute angle in degrees:\n$$\\theta = \\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right) \\approx 19.47^\\circ \\approx 19.5^\\circ \\quad (\\text{to 1 d.p.})$$"
      ],
